        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Petmancer – A Roguelite Dungeon Crawler with Magical Pets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the art of Petmancy in a pixelated roguelite adventure where strategy meets whimsy. </strong>Explore mysterious dungeons, recruit powerful familiars, and outwit your enemies in turn-based battles. Whether you’re commanding an army of enchanted animals or auto-exploring the depths of the dungeons, <i>Petmancer</i> offers an endlessly replayable journey full of charm, challenge, and discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Replayability</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same! Procedurally generated dungeons offer unique layouts, enemies, and loot every time you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Pet Army</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit fierce and whimsical creatures—living and otherwise—to fight by your side. Shape your party to attract pets, position them strategically, and guide their growth. Each pet brings unique abilities to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>16 Unique Hero Classes</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Necromancers to Clairvoyants, choose your playstyle and unlock powerful synergies between talents, pets, and relics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn-Based Combat Meets Auto Exploration</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan every move in tactical battles or let your team explore on their own in idle mode—perfect for casual and hardcore players alike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock Ancient Talents</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match 16 magical talents like Mind Control, Chronomancy, and Chaos to build your own strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prestige &amp; Progression</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the 7 Archmages to unlock new meta-abilities, bosses, and realms. Keep your pets, relics, and talents across runs for true long-term growth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore 14 Themed Realms</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through shrines, fountains, secret rooms, and more in handcrafted environments like Vampire Castles, Underworld Crypts, and the chaotic Astral Spire.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Petmancer – A Roguelite Dungeon Crawler with Magical Pets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the art of Petmancy in a pixelated roguelite adventure where strategy meets whimsy. </strong>Explore mysterious dungeons, recruit powerful familiars, and outwit your enemies in turn-based battles. Whether you’re commanding an army of enchanted animals or auto-exploring the depths of the dungeons, <i>Petmancer</i> offers an endlessly replayable journey full of charm, challenge, and discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Replayability</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same! Procedurally generated dungeons offer unique layouts, enemies, and loot every time you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Pet Army</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit fierce and whimsical creatures—living and otherwise—to fight by your side. Shape your party to attract pets, position them strategically, and guide their growth. Each pet brings unique abilities to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>16 Unique Hero Classes</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Necromancers to Clairvoyants, choose your playstyle and unlock powerful synergies between talents, pets, and relics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn-Based Combat Meets Auto Exploration</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan every move in tactical battles or let your team explore on their own in idle mode—perfect for casual and hardcore players alike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock Ancient Talents</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match 16 magical talents like Mind Control, Chronomancy, and Chaos to build your own strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prestige &amp; Progression</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the 7 Archmages to unlock new meta-abilities, bosses, and realms. Keep your pets, relics, and talents across runs for true long-term growth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore 14 Themed Realms</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through shrines, fountains, secret rooms, and more in handcrafted environments like Vampire Castles, Underworld Crypts, and the chaotic Astral Spire.</p>",
